    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines high-octane real-time combat with tower-climbing exploration and quest-solving elements. Players ascend the Tower of Desolation, battling enemies, upgrading weapons. Save your dying brother from a mysterious sickness. Climb the tower to find the ultimate cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deep into an interconnected world with alternate paths and secret loot. Bring hope to the inhabitants of the Tower as you search for the ultimate cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash destruction through harnessing the power of lightning. Discover new ways to dismantle your enemies as you gain shock-based abilities. Switch between melee and ranged attacks against a fantastic array of mechanized demigods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons, discover new combat skills, and customize a loadout to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the Tower's true purpose as you traverse it's ominous labyrinth. Climb higher to unfold the truth of humanity's common task.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines high-octane real-time combat with tower-climbing exploration and quest-solving elements. Players ascend the Tower of Desolation, battling enemies, upgrading weapons. Save your dying brother from a mysterious sickness. Climb the tower to find the ultimate cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deep into an interconnected world with alternate paths and secret loot. Bring hope to the inhabitants of the Tower as you search for the ultimate cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash destruction through harnessing the power of lightning. Discover new ways to dismantle your enemies as you gain shock-based abilities. Switch between melee and ranged attacks against a fantastic array of mechanized demigods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons, discover new combat skills, and customize a loadout to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the Tower's true purpose as you traverse it's ominous labyrinth. Climb higher to unfold the truth of humanity's common task.</p>",
    "short_description": "In a land they were never meant to enter. A sibling's desperate quest to save her brother will uncover a secret meant to stay buried. Shadow of Mammon is a heart-pounding third-person action RPG shooter delivering intense combat in a captivating narrative.",
